Colonel, we're here. Over.

768
01:25:19,240 --> 01:25:21,840
God help us all.

769
01:25:23,040 --> 01:25:24,280
All right, get out of here... Now.

770
01:25:24,360 --> 01:25:25,720
I'm gonna buy us some time.

771
01:25:25,800 --> 01:25:27,060
