Get to the chopper!

773
01:25:28,400 --> 01:25:30,000
You don't have to do this, Dallas.

774
01:25:30,080 --> 01:25:32,720
Now! Go! Go!

775
01:25:32,800 --> 01:25:34,800
Come on, you motherfuckers!

776
01:25:42,040 --> 01:25:43,200
